    ('admin.article.edit.canonicalTail', 'en-US', ': when an article detail page is published, the system writes canonical from the instance public path and emits JSON-LD per article type. These two items therefore always pass — they are listed only to show that the artifact has them, not as a to-do.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html', 1, now(), now()),
