    ('admin.article.edit.importWhitelistTail', 'zh-CN', ' —— 它们在保存那一刻就被剥掉了，导入自然也看不到。需要分隔线或表格，请到画布里添加对应组件。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.article.edit.importWhitelistTail', 'en-US', ' — they are stripped at that moment, so the import cannot see them either. If you need a rule or a table, add the matching component on the canvas.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/article_edit.html', 1, now(), now()),
