    ('admin.article.translations.addressHint', 'zh-CN', '译文只按「原文 + 语境」寻址，所以同一句话在多篇文章里共用一份译文；改原文后旧译文自动失效（按内容哈希比对），构建期回退原文，不会出现错位的译文。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/article_translations.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.article.translations.addressHint', 'en-US', 'Translations are addressed by "source text + context" only, so the same sentence shares one translation across articles; editing the source text invalidates the old translation (compared by content hash) and the build falls back to the source, so translations never end up mismatched.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/article_translations.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.article.translations.richHint', 'zh-CN', '正文是富文本：译文需与原文**形态一致**（原文含 HTML 标签时译文也要含）。标签白名单在构建期统一清洗，这里只挡住「整段丢了标签」这类明显错误。', 200, 'admin', 'admin/article_translations.html', 1, now(), now()),
    ('admin.article.translations.richHint', 'en-US', 'The body is rich text: the translation must be **shape-consistent** with the source (if the source contains HTML tags, so must the translation). The tag allowlist is enforced at build time; this page only blocks obvious mistakes such as losing every tag.', 200, 'admin', 'admin/article_translations.html', 1, now(), now()),
